WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.590
Roget insisted that Sora wouldn't 
betray the Professor,

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:06.890
and that he would definitely give 
Yuzu over to Academia.

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:09.430
He was trying to get me on his side.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.120
Saying, work together to take over City,

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.460
and protect Yuzu and Serena from Academia.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:15.990
Just then...

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:18.660
Tanner!

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:27.110
I realized that Yuzu was with the 
children, who had come to

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:29.470
cheer Crow on in his fight with Kurosaki.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:37.340
Let's finish this...

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:39.850
Feel the power of the bonds between Commons!

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.860
Thunderbolt Flap!

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:59.470
I saw Yuzu Hiiragi on the course. 
Capture her immediately.

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:00.940
No!

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:02.790
I won't let you!

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:11.320
I won't let you have Yuzu!

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:14.290
Sora won't give Yuzu to Academia, either!

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:17.260
Yuzu, Sora, and I are friends!

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:19.220
I trust my friends!

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:27.240
He doesn't trust me, then?

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:29.500
What a shame.

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:32.570
D-Wheels.

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:36.750
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:38.460
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:41.900
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:44.090
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:22.980
The Bond Between Student and Teacher

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:26.950
Damn it!

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:28.790
Yuzu...

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:35.390
I was raised at Academia. I'd never had a friend.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:40.870
Which meant you and Yuzu were my first...

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:42.520
Sora...

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:45.960
That's why I really want to save Yuzu, at least!

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:49.860
Back then, Sora wasn't lying.

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:51.560
It's okay.

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:54.350
Sora will protect Yuzu, no matter what.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.980
Where did you go, Yuzu?

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:09.290
Roger. We're heading to pick up Yuzu Hiiragi.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:13.260
Yuzu? So security is looking 
for Yuzu, after all.

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:18.300
Something is going on with Yuzu.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:22.350
Clear to the right!

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:23.370
Clear to the left!

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:24.710
Clear up ahead!

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:26.410
Okay, now!

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:29.710
What do you mean, now? 
You aren't saying—

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:30.910
Go!

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:32.620
I have to jump from here?

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:35.220
It's only two stories. You'll be fine!

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:36.880
Hurry up, Yuzu!

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:38.470
Hurry!

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:48.130
You guys are way too worked up...

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.630
What do you expect?

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:53.100
That duel between Crow and 
Kurosaki was too cool!

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:56.640
After watching that, how could 
we not get fired up?

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:59.840
We wanna get out there and fight, too.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:05.100
Boy, I wanna get my own D-Wheel, 
and duel just like Crow!

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:05.820
Me, too.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:06.670
And me!

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:11.020
Sorry, but it seems that dream 
will go unrealized.

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:12.800
Security!

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:13.920
Why?

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:15.230
Yuzu Hiiragi sighted.

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:16.300
Me?

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:17.930
We have her surrounded.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:31.340
Everyone, look over there.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.460
There's an opening.

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:35.680
We could probably make it.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:36.780
Okay, charge!

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:42.950
Level 2 Jutte Fighter tunes Level 4 Jutte Lord!

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:47.990
Face the fangs of the wild beast.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.460
Synchro Summon!

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:52.330
Level 6 Goyo Predator!

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:59.010
Director, we've surrounded Yuzu Hiiragi.

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:02.570
Good... Secure her and bring 
her to me at once.

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:03.380
Yes, sir!

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:05.520
Why is security after me?

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:08.260
They want to send me underground?

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:12.450
I'm sorry. This has nothing 
to do with you guys.

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:16.920
Sure, it does! You're one of us!

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:21.030
Crow always tells us we need 
to take care of our own.

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:23.730
So it has everything to do with us!

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.410
You guys...

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:30.440
If only I had a duel disk, at least...

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:32.970
Bring it on!

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:34.380
We'll fight you!

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:35.450
Yeah!

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:40.090
In this situation, what do I do?

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:42.330
Yuya...

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:44.420
Use this!

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:48.810
This?

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:52.220
Sora!

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:55.730
I activate my spell card Polymerization 
from my hand!

00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:00.190
The inanimate toy that houses the devil,

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:03.020
annihilate the fools who oppose me!

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:05.470
Fusion Summon!

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:09.790
Appear, the magical beast that's 
a combination of all toys!

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:12.070
Frightfur Chimera!

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:19.350
Go... Battle, Frightfur Chimera.

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:21.800
Attack Goyo Chaser!

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:31.320
I set one card and end my turn.

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:33.530
Sora, what are you doing here?

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:37.350
Forget that, and find a way out of here.

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:47.240
My turn!

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:53.080
I also activate my spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:57.190
I use the three monster cards in 
my hand to Fusion Summon.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:02.240
The supreme genius, the triumphant 
chorus, the angel's song...

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:05.060
Follow the baton and stack your power!

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:06.760
Fusion Summon!

00:08:07.370 --> 00:08:10.720
Now come to the stage, to sing 
the song of passion!

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.620
Bloom Prima the Melodious Choir!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:17.160
For each of its fusion components,

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:20.650
Bloom Prima's attack points increase by 300!

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:26.420
Battle, Bloom Prima! Attack Goyo Chaser!

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:33.360
Great!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:34.790
Nice one, Yuzu!

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:38.760
It isn't over yet! Bloom Prima can attack twice!

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:41.530
I attack the other Goyo Chaser!

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:49.240
I end my turn. Now!

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:50.510
All right!

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:51.440
Yeah!

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:54.510
I won't let you! My turn!

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:59.300
Battle! Goyo Predator attacks Bloom Prima!

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:03.100
Bloom Prima still has higher attack points.

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:07.860
I activate my Quick-Play Spell from 
my hand, Rush Recklessly!

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:13.370
Goyo Predator's attack points increase 
by 700 until the end of my turn!

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:18.570
Now go, Goyo Predator...

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:21.040
Destroy Bloom Prima!

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:24.650
I activate my trap Fusion Fright Waltz!

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:34.490
I select Frightfur Chimera and 
Yuzu's Bloom Prima,

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:36.620
and add their attack points together!

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:40.860
Excepting Fusion Monsters, 
all Special Summoned monsters

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:44.460
with lower attack points than 
that sum, are destroyed!

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:45.500
What?

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:51.800
And I deal that total as damage to the 
controllers of the destroyed monsters.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.760
5600 damage?

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:58.880
Now... Dance, Frightfur Chimera.

00:09:59.150 --> 00:10:01.510
Dance, Bloom Prima!

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:04.520
Destroy all those on the sidelines.

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:07.490
This stage is yours alone!

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:16.430
Un, deux, trois! Un, deux, trois!

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:09.290
Thanks, Sora. You saved me.

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:11.840
Now, Yuzu! Hurry!

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:13.590
Yeah, come with us.

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:23.190
What? You failed to secure her?!

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:28.170
A b-boy, who used Fusion Summon, appeared.

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:30.840
Fusion... Academia?

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:33.350
Could it be Sora?

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.140
Attention, all security.

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:41.290
Cordon off all City sectors. 
Trace Yuzu Hiiragi's flight.

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:45.350
She's working with a duelist from Academia.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:49.090
The minute you find her, use all 
your power to bring her in.

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:52.890
We must not let Academia have Yuzu Hiiragi!

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:59.050
You go that way! Keep up the investigation!

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:04.370
They're gone?

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:05.260
Looks like.

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.040
I think we made it out.

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:13.210
Then, you're the one who saved me 
after I fell off the highway, Sora?

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:14.240
Seriously?

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:15.720
From that height?

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:16.920
Wow!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.420
Who are you?

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:23.180
I'm...

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:27.430
My teacher.

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:28.440
Teacher?

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:32.630
Yes. He's the one who taught 
me how to Fusion Summon.

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:37.000
I see... That's why you were so in sync before.

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:40.330
The way your two monsters danced together...

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:43.040
It made my heart flutter a little bit!

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:45.390
It wasn't just elegant...

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:47.610
It was really strong!

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:51.020
It destroyed those security monsters, 
one after another!

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:52.720
I felt so much better!

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:54.950
You weirdos!

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:58.070
Really, thanks.

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:00.390
You saved me twice.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:05.860
Though, the second time would have been 
unnecessary if you hadn't run off.

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:10.070
I'm sorry, but I woke up, 
and no one was there.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:14.450
Yes, that was also my fault, 
for leaving you alone.

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:19.040
At the time, I wanted to tell Yuya that 
you were safe, as soon as possible.

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:21.560
Where's Yuya now?

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:24.010
He beat Shinji in the match after yours,

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:27.880
then drove away from the Duel Palace...

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:31.220
He was probably worried and 
went searching for you.

00:13:31.480 --> 00:13:33.690
Yes, that's right.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:37.600
He went looking for me, to make 
sure you were okay.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:39.420
But...

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:40.660
Look out!

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:43.100
Yuya!

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:46.920
Go, Sora! Protect Yuzu!

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:53.680
Oh, no! Then it's my fault that Yuya...

00:13:57.620 --> 00:13:58.540
Yuzu...

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.740
A control device for Yuya Sakaki?

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:04.590
Indeed.

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:06.990
To put him under my control,

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:10.460
I want you to implant the same control 
device in his brain as Sergey's.

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:13.660
But it can't be done so quickly...

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:17.200
We just started Sergey's readjustment surgery.

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:19.670
When will that end?

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.820
At the very earliest,

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:24.180
it could take until midnight.

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:28.380
You have until sundown. 
Have it finished by then.

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:32.910
Then I want you to begin the 
surgery on Yuya Sakaki,

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:35.160
and finish it by morning.

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:38.910
It needs to be done by the first semifinal match

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:42.520
tomorrow, between Yuya and Crow Hogan.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:45.260
Roger that...

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:48.720
From the way Sora is acting,

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:52.710
Academia may already be on the move.

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:56.950
Before their full force arrives, I must 
have City in the palm of my hand,

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.590
to prepare my own defenses.

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:05.820
Sergey and Yuya Sakaki are essential to that.

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:12.650
I can't just hide out here forever.

00:15:12.650 --> 00:15:14.890
I need to save Yuya, fast!

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:17.480
You can't save him!

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:20.440
Security's after you!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.900
If you go, you'll just get caught, too!

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:26.390
But Yuya's worried about me...

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:29.470
I can't stay here and do nothing.

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:31.590
Why are they after you?

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:36.550
They want to send me underground.

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:41.250
But would they send all that security 
after you, just for that?

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:43.090
What do you mean?

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:46.060
Academia is after you.

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:50.890
It's possible someone, high in the 
Synchro Dimension hierarchy,

00:15:50.890 --> 00:15:53.530
has ties to Academia.

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:58.170
And Dennis, an Academia spy, 
has returned to the Fusion Dimension.

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:01.360
It's only a matter of time until 
Academia makes its move.

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:03.010
I can't let you go.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:07.210
Sora... Do you really mean that?

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:12.960
W-Wait... Why are you glaring at each other?

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:16.700
You're teacher and student, right? 
It isn't good for you to fight.

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:20.570
We aren't fighting. There's just 
something I need to find out.

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:22.730
Find out? What is it?

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:23.390
Sora...

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:26.920
I might get caught by Academia.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:29.850
That's why you won't let me go save Yuya.

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:31.820
Is that right?

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:32.870
Yes.

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:34.250
In other words, Sora...

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:37.510
You've already severed ties with Academia.

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:39.840
That's right, isn't it?

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:42.710
Isn't that right, Sora?

00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:46.820
No, I'm still with Academia.

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:48.080
You aren't...

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:51.290
In your heart, you've already given up on them.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:54.920
If you hadn't, you wouldn't want to save me!

00:16:56.400 --> 00:17:01.640
No matter what I think, I'm still with Academia!

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:03.850
Now and forever!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.970
I was raised by Academia.

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:12.150
I have no choice but to live as an 
Academia duel warrior forever.

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:15.320
That's a destiny I can never escape!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:19.330
What's he talking about? What's Academia?

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:20.700
That reminds me...

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:23.690
When I saw Yuzu in the city, 
she was talking about that.

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:26.460
An attack by Academia or something...

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:28.920
Y-Yeah, that's what she said.

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:33.900
An attack? You mean your 
teacher is with them, Yuzu?

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:38.320
I cannot change my destiny. 
But you're different.

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:40.550
You have nothing to do with Academia.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:43.910
You should go back home, 
to where you belong.

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:45.840
That's right...

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:47.980
I should have done this from the start,

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:50.450
rather than thinking of an exchange for Serena.

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:52.150
What are you going to do?

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:54.890
I'm sending you home now.

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:56.680
To the Standard Dimension.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:57.760
No!

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.080
You can't do that!

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:03.230
You can't save only me!

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:05.920
Yuya told me...

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:08.430
If we went home, it would 
be all of us, together.

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:10.920
I can't leave my friends behind!

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:13.620
Friends?

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:17.900
Who's there?!

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:22.390
Tsukikage, of the Fuma.

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:26.520
During the Maiami City Championship's battle royal,

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:31.820
one of those whom you turned into 
a card was Hikage, my brother!

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:37.750
Finding his enemy here, I see his 
guidance was not mistaken.

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:39.700
Let us fight!

00:18:40.030 --> 00:18:41.640
Wait, Tsukikage...

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:44.270
This is no time to be fighting with our allies.

00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:45.740
What are you saying?

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:48.970
He is with Academia! He is our enemy!

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:50.540
Sora's different.

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:52.080
Isn't that right, Sora?

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:54.180
You aren't with Academia anymore.

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:58.860
Cut ties with the Professor, 
and stop making people sad!

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:01.370
Making people sad?

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:16.530
I'm sorry about your brother.

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:19.900
But I know it isn't something 
that "sorry" can fix.

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:24.080
If you won't be satisfied otherwise, 
you can do what you like to me.

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:28.850
But I want you to wait until I 
keep my promise to Yuya.

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:30.310
Promise?

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.620
Yuya is my friend.

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:36.290
He trusted me, and told 
me to keep Yuzu safe.

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:40.490
So I've decided to protect Yuzu to the end.

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:46.630
And, Yuzu... If you think of me 
as a friend, please trust me.

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:49.340
I'll bring Yuya to you.

00:19:49.970 --> 00:19:54.470
Until then, could you keep 
Yuzu in a safe place?

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:58.710
Once I get Yuya out, I'll come to you.

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:03.030
I'll return to you. I won't run or hide.

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:06.940
Very well.

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:12.920
Then, I wish to hide Yuzu Hiiragi and the 
children in the underground facility.

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:14.890
Us, too? How come?

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:18.440
You mean, we have to do forced labor?

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:20.160
I don't want to go there.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:25.460
Your association with Yuzu Hiiragi will 
cause suspicion to fall on you, as well.

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:27.680
It is dangerous for you to 
remain on the surface.

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:31.140
Security is already on the move 
in all corners of City.

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:36.590
Security has even taken control of 
the Administrative Council building.

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:40.020
It is even difficult for me to reach Reiji Akaba.

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:41.790
Oh, no...

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:45.990
If you wish to remain here, we have 
no choice but to go underground.

00:20:45.990 --> 00:20:47.370
But worry not.

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:51.080
I shall see to your safety.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:54.270
And some Lancers are also underground.

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:58.870
I see... I have trusted friends there, too.

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:00.710
Trust me, as well.

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:03.670
I'll bring Yuya back, no matter what.

00:21:04.260 --> 00:21:07.950
I'll make it so you can return 
with your friends, together.

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:10.230
Yes, I trust you.

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:12.010
You're our friend, Sora.

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:14.660
And you're my teacher!

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:17.920
A student has to trust her teacher, right?

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:19.770
Yuzu...

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:25.700
That's no good! Elbows should 
be more like this!

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:30.870
It seems I have much more to teach you.

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:42.800
Now, for the final battle of the second round!

00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:45.350
The last pair, trying for the final four, is

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:48.960
Hugo and Serena!

00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:54.320
It isn't only Sergey and Yuya.

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:56.790
Serena has an important role to play, too.

00:21:57.510 --> 00:22:00.010
To be loved by both Tops and Commons.

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:04.500
And to become the star of 
hope for everyone in City.

00:23:49.760 --> 00:23:52.480
My heart is on fire, too.

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:55.410
Rin... And Yuzu, the girl from heaven.

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:58.650
For your sake, I will win this duel!

00:23:58.650 --> 00:24:01.200
Stop spacing out.

00:24:01.200 --> 00:24:03.180
Your dueling is full 
of sloppy mistakes.

00:24:03.180 --> 00:24:05.920
Dueling isn't something you 
can calculate like that.

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:08.990
Without precise strategy, you can't win!

00:24:08.990 --> 00:24:11.460
No, winning is based on the moment's luck!

00:24:11.940 --> 00:24:15.720
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Dice Roll of Fate.

00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:17.620
The fun is only getting started!
